# --------------------
# Project Files to Ignore
# --------------------
# Build and object files
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
# Folders generated by Visual Studio or IDEs
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# NuGet cache files
*.nupkg
*.cache
packages/
# This is typically an empty directory
# Restore will pull down dependencies as needed

# Log files and database files
*.log
*.bak
*.sqlite

# --------------------
# Specific Fixes for Your Project
# --------------------
# This specifically ignores the large file that failed your push.
# Since it's in a debug folder, the 'bin/' rule above should catch it, 
# but it's good practice to ensure the whole build output is ignored.
TypeBeat.Desktop/bin/
